# What the optional AI suggestions need (no versions). update_deps.py installs the
# latest of these, tests them, and writes the exact versions to requirements-ai.txt.
# CPU-only PyTorch builds. Without this index, Linux installs the CUDA build, which adds
# ~2.7 GB of NVIDIA libraries that can't run in the dev container anyway.
--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu
torch
torchvision
open_clip_torch
huggingface_hub
